sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Flutter as Flutter Web App
    participant Firebase as Firebase Services
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Backend
    participant Gemini as Gemini 3 API
    participant GCP as Google Cloud<br/>(Speech/TTS)
    
    Note over User,GCP: Authentication Flow
    User->>Flutter: Open App
    Flutter->>Firebase: Check Auth State
    Firebase-->>Flutter: User Status
    alt Not Authenticated
        User->>Flutter: Click Google Sign In
        Flutter->>Firebase: Sign In with Google
        Firebase-->>Flutter: Auth Token & User
        Flutter->>Firebase: Create/Update User Doc
    end
    
    Note over User,GCP: Chat with AI Features
    User->>Flutter: Type Message
    User->>Flutter: Request Tone Analysis
    Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/tone
    FastAPI->>Gemini: Analyze Tone + Context
    Gemini-->>FastAPI: Tone Result (JSON)
    FastAPI-->>Flutter: Tone Response
    
    User->>Flutter: Request Translation
    Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/translate
    FastAPI->>Gemini: Translate Text
    Gemini-->>FastAPI: Translated Text
    FastAPI-->>Flutter: Translation Response
    
    User->>Flutter: Send Message
    Flutter->>Firebase: Write to Firestore
    Firebase-->>Flutter: Real-time Update
    Flutter-->>User: Display Message
    
    Note over User,GCP: Real-time Voice Call Translation
    User->>Flutter: Start Call
    Flutter->>FastAPI: WebSocket /ws/call/{id}?target_lang=es
    FastAPI-->>Flutter: Connection Accepted
    
    loop Audio Streaming
        User->>Flutter: Speak (Audio Chunk)
        Flutter->>FastAPI: Send Audio Bytes (WebSocket)
        
        alt Translation Enabled
            FastAPI->>GCP: Stream to Speech-to-Text V2
            GCP-->>FastAPI: Interim/Final Transcript
            FastAPI->>Gemini: Translate Text
            Gemini-->>FastAPI: Translated Text
            FastAPI->>GCP: Text-to-Speech
            GCP-->>FastAPI: Audio Response
            FastAPI->>Flutter: Broadcast Translated Audio
        else Passthrough Mode
            FastAPI->>Flutter: Broadcast Raw Audio
        end
        
        Flutter-->>User: Play Audio
    end
    
    User->>Flutter: End Call
    Flutter->>FastAPI: Close WebSocket
    FastAPI-->>Flutter: Disconnected
    
    Note over User,GCP: Batch Translation (Chat History)
    User->>Flutter: View Chat in Different Language
    Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/translate-batch
    FastAPI->>Gemini: Translate Multiple Messages
    Gemini-->>FastAPI: Batch Translations
    FastAPI-->>Flutter: All Translations
    Flutter-->>User: Display Translated Chat
